       fhir:ElementDefinition.short [ fhir:value "Base for all types and resources" ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "A name for a person. A sequence of name parts, such as given name or family name, prefix, suffix, etc. Examples for person name values are \"Jim Bob Walton, Jr.\", \"Adam Everyman\", etc. A person name may be as simple as a character string or may consist of several person name parts, such as, \"Jim\", \"Bob\", \"Walton\", and \"Jr.\". PN differs from EN because the qualifier type cannot include LS (Legal Status)." ] ;
